diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/docs/extensions.md b/packages/coding-agent/docs/extensions.md
index 076208e9..fdd2d365 100644
--- a/packages/coding-agent/docs/extensions.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/docs/extensions.md
@@ -1951,6 +1951,14 @@ ctx.ui.setStatus("my-ext", undefined);  // Clear
 ctx.ui.setWorkingMessage("Thinking deeply...");
 ctx.ui.setWorkingMessage();  // Restore default
 
+// Live transcript mode (interactive mode only)
+ctx.ui.setLiveTranscriptMode({ toolRows: "hide", thinking: "hide", working: "hide" });
+ctx.ui.setLiveTranscriptMode();  // Restore default live rendering
+
+// Historical transcript mode (interactive mode only)
+ctx.ui.setHistoricalTranscriptMode({ toolRows: "hide", thinking: "hide" });
+ctx.ui.setHistoricalTranscriptMode();  // Restore default history rendering
+
 // Widget above editor (default)
 ctx.ui.setWidget("my-widget", ["Line 1", "Line 2"]);
 // Widget below editor
@@ -1995,6 +2003,23 @@ ctx.ui.setTheme(lightTheme!);  // Or switch by Theme object
 ctx.ui.theme.fg("accent", "styled text");  // Access current theme
 ```
 
+`setLiveTranscriptMode()` only affects live interactive-mode rendering. Existing session history stays as-is, and suppressed live rows are not backfilled automatically, which makes it a good fit for activity widgets and other in-progress views.
+
+Useful live mode switches:
+- `toolRows: "hide"` suppresses live tool execution rows.
+- `thinking: "collapse"` keeps live thinking as the hidden-thinking label.
+- `thinking: "hide"` removes the live thinking placeholder entirely.
+- `working: "hide"` suppresses the separate live working spinner row.
+
+`setHistoricalTranscriptMode()` applies the same idea to replayed interactive transcript history. Hidden historical rows stay in session storage and may still appear in non-interactive views, but `/resume` and `pi --session <id>` can render a compact extension-owned view instead of replaying default tool rows and thinking blocks.
+
+Useful historical mode switches:
+- `toolRows: "hide"` suppresses replayed tool execution rows reconstructed from assistant tool calls.
+- `thinking: "collapse"` keeps replayed thinking as the hidden-thinking label.
+- `thinking: "hide"` removes the replayed thinking placeholder entirely.
+
+See [examples/extensions/live-transcript-mode.ts](../examples/extensions/live-transcript-mode.ts) for a minimal usage example.
+
 ### Custom Components
 
 For complex UI, use `ctx.ui.custom()`. This temporarily replaces the editor with your component until `done()` is called:
